---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/portrait.svg';
---

<Base title="About — Maarij Alam">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="about">
    <div class="about__portrait">
      <Image src={portrait} alt="TODO: alt text describing the portrait" widths={[400, 600, 800]} sizes="(max-width: 640px) 60vw, 240px" />
    </div>

    <div class="about__prose">
      <p>TODO: opening paragraph — who I am, what I'm studying, where I'm from and where I'm heading.</p>

      <p>TODO: the path into engineering — how I got here, what drew me toward embedded systems and RF, and where the pull toward software is coming from.</p>

      <p>TODO: the AQUA Project internship — what it is, what I built, what I took away.</p>

      <p>TODO: tutoring EEE3088F — what I teach, what I've learned from teaching it.</p>

      <p>TODO: closing paragraph — how I think about engineering work, and what I'm looking for after I graduate in 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-7);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }
  .about__portrait :global(img),
  .about__portrait :global(svg) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 0;
  }
  .about__prose { max-width: 60ch; }
  .about__prose p { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-6); }
    .about__portrait { max-width: 240px; }
  }
</style>
